FINAL USER JOURNEY

The complete platform should work like this:

Parent/Student

Website Open → Class Select → Subject Select → Area Select → Search → Multiple Tutors → Compare Profiles → View Tutor → Send Enquiry → Contact Tutor → Start Tuition

Tutor

Become a Tutor → Registration → Submit Profile → Admin Review → Approval → Public Profile → Receive Enquiries

Admin

Login → Dashboard → Manage Tutors → Approve Tutors → Manage Requirements → Manage Enquiries → Manage Reviews → Manage Website Content

