IMPORTANT

Build this as a real functional Tutor Marketplace, not as a static landing page.

All major buttons, searches, filters, forms, tutor profiles and admin functions should be functional and connected to the database.

Use reusable components, clean architecture, scalable code and production-quality UI.

The website should be ready for future expansion beyond Allahabad/Prayagraj to other cities in Uttar Pradesh and eventually across India.
